Package: pingvakt
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libgtk-3-0, @WEBKIT@, libcap2-bin
Recommends: traceroute, libnotify-bin
Maintainer: PingVakt <info@pingvakt.local>
Description: Latency and packet loss monitoring
 PingVakt pings many targets at once (ICMP, TCP port, HTTP(S) and DNS), shows
 latency, jitter and packet loss in real time and over time, and alerts with
 popups, sound, system notifications, email and a log file.
